# Raw per-scenario measurement dumps (README is the durable record). The one
# exception is results/summary.json: a published aggregate of already-
# computed rates, percentiles, and counts (no raw per-sample memory/latency
# series) — it is NOT independently recomputable raw samples, only a
# durable record of numbers this probe already computed, so
# `bun run src/run.ts report` can still render the README on a fresh
# checkout that has none of the raw per-scenario records below.
results/*
!results/summary.json
